  "title": "JAMANVAAR Admin — Restaurant Operations & Intelligence",
  "text": "QA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734\nADMIN\nQA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nOPERATIONS\nDashboard\nBilling / Invoices\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nReservations\nKitchen / KOT\nDIGITAL ORDERING\nQR Table Ordering\nON\nMENU & INVENTORY\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nInventory & Recipes\nPurchasing & Stock Control\nPEOPLE & CASH\nCustomers CRM\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nPayments & Split\nOffers & Coupons\nShift & Cash Drawer\nKIOSK\nKiosk Terminals\nANALYTICS & SYSTEM\nReports & Analytics\nPrinters & Devices\nReceipt & E-Bill\nSync & Devices\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nPrinters & Peripheral Devices\nESC/POS HARDWARE\n\nConfigure ESC/POS thermal printers (80mm/58mm), KOT station routing, and run test prints.\n\nConfigure Printer\nPOS COUNTER PC\nCounter Terminal\n✓ Localhost Active\nRECEIPT PRINTERS\nThermal 80mm ESC/POS\n0 Configured\nCASH DRAWER\nRJ11 Kick Solenoid\nAuto-Open on Bill\nLAN MESH BRIDGE\nMulti-Device Sync\nPort 5178 Listening\nNo Thermal Printers Configured\n\nConnect your 80mm or 58mm ESC/POS receipt or kitchen KOT printer via LAN Ethernet, USB, or Bluetooth.\n\n+ Configure First Printer\nLAN Sync Bridge & Cross-Machine Pairing\nMULTI-DEVICE SYNC\n\nSynchronize POS Counter PCs, Admin Laptops, Captain APKs, and Kitchen KDS screens over the local Wi-Fi / LAN network.\n\n⚡ Force Sync Now\nMain POS Counter Server Address (LAN Host IP:Port):\nSave & Connect\nTip: If this is the Main Counter PC, leave as http://localhost:5178. On other laptops/tablets, enter the Main PC's LAN IP.\nConnection Health & Latency:\nTest Ping & Latency\nKitchen Printer Routing\n\nWhich physical printer handles each kitchen station's tickets\n\nMain Kitchen / Curry Station:\nUnassigned (falls back to default printer)\nTandoor Section:\nUnassigned (falls back to default printer)\nBeverages Bar:\nUnassigned (falls back to default printer)\nDessert Counter:\nUnassigned (falls back to default printer)\nTransactional Print Queue Spooler\n0 Jobs Total\nProcess Queue Now\n\nNo print jobs in spooler queue. Jobs dispatched upon customer payment will appear here.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
